{"text":{"en":{"패킹 SCB형 (DKB)":"Packing SCB Type (DKB)","<p class=\"eyebrow\">Dust Seal / Packing SCB(DKB) Type</p> <h2>더스트씰 · 패킹 SCB형 (DKB)</h2> <p>이물질 유입을 막는 <strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">더스트 씰</strong>로 사용하는 패킹 SCB형(DKB)입니다.</p>":"<p class=\"eyebrow\">Dust Seal / Packing SCB(DKB) Type</p> <h2>Dust Seal · Packing SCB Type (DKB)</h2> <p>Packing SCB type (DKB), used as a <strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">dust seal</strong> to keep out foreign particles.</p>","<img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/packing_scb_diagram.webp?v=wm3\" alt=\"패킹 SCB형(DKB) 도면\" style=\"height: 220px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain;\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ 단면도<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">d=내경 · D=외경 · H=높이 · t=폭</span></p>":"<img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/packing_scb_diagram.webp?v=wm3\" alt=\"Packing SCB Type (DKB) Drawing\" style=\"height: 220px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain;\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ Cross-Section<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">d=Inner Diameter · D=Outer Diameter · H=Height · t=Width</span></p>","서울 구로구 경인로53길 32, 미래에코타워 B101·102호":"B101–102, Mirae Eco Tower, 32 Gyeongin-ro 53-gil, Guro-gu, Seoul"},"ja":{"패킹 SCB형 (DKB)":"パッキン SCB型(DKB)","<p class=\"eyebrow\">Dust Seal / Packing SCB(DKB) Type</p> <h2>더스트씰 · 패킹 SCB형 (DKB)</h2> <p>이물질 유입을 막는 <strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">더스트 씰</strong>로 사용하는 패킹 SCB형(DKB)입니다.</p>":"<p class=\"eyebrow\">Dust Seal / Packing SCB(DKB) Type</p> <h2>ダストシール ・ パッキンSCB型(DKB)</h2> <p>異物の侵入を防ぐ<strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">ダストシール</strong>として使用するパッキンSCB型(DKB)です。</p>","<img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/packing_scb_diagram.webp?v=wm3\" alt=\"패킹 SCB형(DKB) 도면\" style=\"height: 220px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain;\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ 단면도<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">d=내경 · D=외경 · H=높이 · t=폭</span></p>":"<img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/packing_scb_diagram.webp?v=wm3\" alt=\"パッキンSCB型(DKB)